# The rule of thumb on a busy afternoon: enough moving with purpose, something new every
# minute, never more than the caps (home corner: 3 to 20 movers, 1 to 3 happenings a minute).
set unlock all
set season summer
set clock day
set land 1
place cottage @32,30 0
place coop @26,32 0
place beehive @36,31 0
place flowers_red @34,28
place flowers_white @35,28
place flowers_violet @36,28
place flowers_red @36,29
place planter @24,33 0
place planter @25,33 1
place campfire @30,36 0
set camera 30 30 1
fast 15
set lively reset
fast 60
expect lively 3 20 1 3 0.9
shot shots/lively.png
quit
